WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Brightwater Plumbing, a sample business, enters its website.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.000
The owner picks a goal: get more qualified leads.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
MAIRO reads the website and shows what it found, and where.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
What the website didn't say is asked, not guessed. The owner confirms the offer and how far they travel.

5
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
A plan: one Meta campaign, with a form inside the ad, for homeowners within 15 miles.

6
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Why that audience, and an example budget. The owner sets the real one.

7
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Three ad directions. One is recommended as the first test.

8
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.500
The owner picks it and rewrites the opening line. The original is kept.

9
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:38.000
Previews show the ad in the feed and in Stories, on a phone.

10
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.500
Before launch: every check, and the Meta connection, in one place.

11
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:49.000
Nothing runs until the owner approves this exact ad and budget.

12
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Results, with sample figures: money spent, leads, and which leads were qualified and booked.

13
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.000
The owner marks a lead as booked.

14
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
MAIRO proposes a next step and says why. The owner decides.
